                                                "sense_id": "d32828e7-d5f0-3a03-abd0-e860a6fddc85",
                                                "text": "In the U.S., Akers would like to see all hermit crabs legally reclassified as exotic pets, like an alligator or an ocelot, so their sale and ownership could be regulated. To her, every crab’s life is precious."
                                            }
